        <p class="kt-route-credit" id="kt-trip-drive-credit" hidden>Routes and drive times: car routing by <a href="https://routing.openstreetmap.de/about.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OSRM (FOSSGIS)</a>, map data \xA9 <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenStreetMap contributors</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/fixthemap" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">fix the map</a>. Not checked for RV height, weight, or length.</p>
